# What a person reads to record their voice: the way people talk to the assistant, with varied sounds.
voice-phrase-1 = Nestor, turn on the lights in the living room.
voice-phrase-2 = What will the weather be like tomorrow morning?
voice-phrase-3 = Remind me to call the plumber on Thursday.
voice-phrase-4 = Add bread, apples and coffee to the shopping list.
voice-phrase-5 = Tell me the story of a lighthouse keeper.

# Recording a voice aloud, on a satellite.
voice-enroll-start = I'm listening. Repeat after me: { $phrase }
voice-enroll-next = Good. Now: { $phrase }
voice-again-too-short = That was a bit short. Once more: { $phrase }
voice-again-too-quiet = I could barely hear you. A little louder: { $phrase }
voice-again-too-loud = That was too loud. A little softer: { $phrase }
voice-again-other-voice = That didn't sound like the same voice. Once more: { $phrase }
voice-enroll-done = Done: I'll recognise your voice now.
